{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["And the reason for <b>\"but My face shall not be seen\"</b> — the illuminating face, as I explained (in verse 18, and see 32:4). And it is possible that the word \"אֲחֹרָי\" is like the expression \"אָחוֹר וָקֶדֶם צַרְתָּנִי\" (Psalms 139:5), according to the interpretation of our Sages (see Eruvin 18a)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {0 "The abbreviation 'ועי׳ ל״ד' is resolved as a cross-reference to Exodus 32:4, following the pattern of his earlier cross-references in this commentary section."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:21:04.610351920Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}